{"id":"b41e0f05a0c07f8d","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-compactness.md","title":"Compactness Theorem","display":"Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-compactness","aliases":["93-thm-compactness"],"display":"Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-compactness-—-Compactness-Theorem\">thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and its semantic consequence relation are from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\Gamma_0\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\Gamma_0\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Equivalently, a set of sentences has a model iff every finite subset has a model. Consequence compactness requires existence of one finite premise subset entailing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>, not entailment by every finite subset.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-compactness-—-Compactness-Theorem","text":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)$ and its semantic consequence relation are from [[93-df-semantic-consequence]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Gamma\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\Gamma_0\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1233,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e93b2477e743baa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["6b63f2f43b5511ee","8b587d680bb02f51","cc9bc888c7dda430"]